/ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jit-sí hiong-hióng hût-rien-kân goà m-jāi-bêh-ru-hó\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>想欲<rt>슐뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>問<rt>믕-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>影<rt>얄ˋ</rt></ruby>’<ruby>뽀<rt>ˏ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siṵ-bêh-mng-lì u-yà̰’bó\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>講<rt>겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"jît\">這<rt>짇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>回<rt>훼-</rt></ruby><ruby>事<rt>수ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>烏白想<rt>어ˉ벻슐ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lì kông-bo-jît-hue-sū si-goà lêh-ōr-peh-siṵ̄\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby title=\"kông\">講<rt>겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>이<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby> <ruby>只<rt>지ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"jit-e\">一个<rt>짇에-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"phôr-thông\">普通<rt>퍼ˆ텅ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby title=\"pieng-yù\">朋友<rt>볭유ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lì kông-ī jî-si-jit-e-phôr-thông’e pieng-yù\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\"><ruby title=\"jît-e\">這个<rt>짇ˆ에</rt></ruby></span><ruby>理由<rt>리ˆ유ˊ</rt></ruby>, <ruby title=\"jiâh\">遮<rt>쟣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>勉強<rt>뼨ˆ경ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jît-e-lî-yú, jiâh-biên-kiòng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>也<rt>야-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>猶原<rt>유ˉ꽌ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>激慐慐<rt>곅ˆ껑껑ˉ</rt></ruby><a href=\"#_ftn1\" id=\"_ftnref1\"><strong>¹</strong></a>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goa